OL,3,GNEWSAResidents in limbo two months
OL,4,Aafter roof collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreenwich Council said work to remove
OL,7,Fdangerous masonry was under way, with
OL,8,Finspections to follow before residents
OL,9,Fcould return to their homes.
